Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back in here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,麦蒂 快回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maddie Go back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员们 我们现在看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we are witnessing here, Senators,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个被遗忘的古老超级物种的回归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the return of an ancient and forgotten super species.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哥斯拉 穆托 金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godzilla, the MUTOs, Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信这些泰坦巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe that these "Titans"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,以及其他与他们一样的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and others like them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们的生态提供了必要的平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}provide an essential balance to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有的巨兽可能构成威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while some may pose a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但帝王组织有独特能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monarch is uniquely prepared to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,能辨别这些泰坦中哪些会威胁我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which of these Titans are here to threaten us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,以及哪些能保护我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and which of these Titans are here to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的五年级历史课演讲 克尔曼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for the fifth grade history lesson, Mr. Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们仍未听到一个充分理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we still haven't heard one good reason
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么帝王组织不应该收归军事管辖范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why Monarch shouldn't fall under military jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,又或者为什么我们不应该消灭这些巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or why these creatures shouldn't be exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,帝王组织的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monarch was tasked
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是发现并摧毁这些放射性巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with finding and destroying these radioactive monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们如果无法或者不愿透露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you either can't or won't tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,到底有多少巨兽及他们为何出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how many there are or why they're showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在应该由军队去消灭他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, maybe it's time for the military to put them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,猎杀他们不是明智之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing them would be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们因人类而回归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They returned because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:12:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,正是我们的原子试爆唤醒了哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was our atomic testing that awoke Gojira.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,其他巨兽 如穆托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other creatures like the MUTOs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是被露天开采和地震勘测引出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from strip mining and seismic surveys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们不是怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these are not monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是动物 只想讨回一个曾经属于他们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are animals rising to reclaim a world that was once theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这听起来像是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It almost sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你想保护他们 芹泽博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're protecting them, Doctor Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好像你们佩服他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if you admire them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我敬佩所有的生命形态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admire all forms of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员们 如果我们希望存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senators, if we hope to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到与泰坦巨兽共存的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must find ways to coexist with Titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,与哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Gojira.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,产生一种共生关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sort of symbiotic relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,比如狮子和老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the lion and the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,又或者蝎子和青蛙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the scorpion and the frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.18,0:12:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你想把哥斯拉当成我们的宠物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you'd want to make Godzilla our pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们成为他的宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be his.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 不 不 实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... No. No, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽博士不是那个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what Doctor Serizawa meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 并不是说成为他的宠物 - 山姆 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one is implying that we would be Godzilla's or anyone's pet.- Sam, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽博士 格雷厄姆博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Serizawa, Doctor Graham,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:12:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听证会还在进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this hearing is not adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽博士 我希望你明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Serizawa, I hope you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,中断离席的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the consequences of walking out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 不如这样把 参议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you know what, Senators,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在我和同事商量的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while I confer with my colleagues here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我给大家放一个简短的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna set you up with a very brief
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,并且十分有趣的纪录片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pretty fun documentary
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,关于泰坦巨兽繁殖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on Titan reproduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,影片在重点部位都打了马赛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this is the one where the genitals are blurred out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没的话 你们可以投诉我的助手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if not, you can leave a comment with my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,视频在这就断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The feed cuts out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,幸存者未能给我们提供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The survivors haven't been able to give us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的资讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much more than what the footage allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.69,0:14:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只说了艾玛和麦蒂森被劫走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only that Emma and Madison were the only ones taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该在她身边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've been there for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信他们的目标是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe they were after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,奥卡音频机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们认为他们需要艾玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, that's why we think they need Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她深信若能复制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She believed that if we could somehow replicate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦用来沟通的声纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the biosonar the Titans use to communicate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么鬼东西 我帮忙构建了原型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what the hell it is. I helped build the prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 山姆克尔曼 我是技术负责人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Sam Coleman. I'm the head of technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我加入了帝王组织 呃 就在你离开后不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I joined Monarch, uh, shortly after you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你妻子的粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a big fan of your wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只是工作方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...'s work. And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来很尴尬 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That just came out so weird, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛和我摧毁了原型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma and I destroyed the prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后艾玛决定重建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Emma decided to rebuild it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,自从旧金山事件后 她回到了波士顿老家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After San Francisco, she went home to Boston,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,花了几年时间研发它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spent years developing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为这可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thought it could help...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可以干嘛？让她扮演上帝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would help what? Play God?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是为了阻止再次袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Help prevent another attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,奥卡是一所研究所的科学项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ORCA was a grad school science project.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,目的是让鲸鱼远离海岸线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was meant to keep whales away from the shoreline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不是让你们和那些怪兽沟通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so you could talk to your little creatures out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 他们会认为那是同类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, they'll think it's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们用了错误音频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You use the wrong frequency on one of 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们将为成千上万次旧金山这样的时间负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're gonna be responsible for 1,000 San Franciscos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们需要取回机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why we need to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛总说没人比你更了解奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma always said no one knew the ORCA better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西就不该存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It shouldn't even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That may be, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但它已落入坏人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's fallen into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 奥卡是唯一的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And right now, the ORCA is the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能让艾玛和麦蒂森活着的保命符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keeping Emma and Madison alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,马克 我们知道你很受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark, we know you're hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我们找到奥卡 就能找到你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we find the ORCA, we'll find your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次和艾玛通话实在什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you spoke to Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大约三年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,旧金山事件后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After San Francisco,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回到了波士顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we went back home to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,试图修补残破的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tried to put the pieces back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛治疗的方法是加倍努力拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma dealt with it by doubling down on saving the world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始酗酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I started drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法告诉你我有多么恨自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how much I hated myself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为让麦蒂森就这样看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for letting Maddie see me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 介意我打个岔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you mind if we cut in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一定向看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just, you're gonna wanna see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛结合了生物声学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma combined the bioacoustics
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,混合了不同的泰坦 创造了奥卡讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of different Titans to create the ORCA's signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一种基线频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sort of baseline frequency
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,能让所有巨兽都回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that all the creatures respond to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,吸引他们 吓跑他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attracting them, repelling them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至有时能让他们平静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even at times calming them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真的非常了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty remarkable actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是我们还不知道她混合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The problem is we don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哪些泰坦的频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which Titans she combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你能识别出这些频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you can identify those frequencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能跟踪奥卡讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll be able to track the ORCA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,找到艾玛和麦蒂森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and find Emma and Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,到底有多少种巨兽啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of these things are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在哥斯拉之后有17只 还在一直增加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventeen and counting after Gojira.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,17只？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventeen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,其中大部分在休眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of them were discovered in deep hibernation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的被封锁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While others we've contained
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在全球的顶级秘密基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at top secret sites around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,柬埔寨 墨西哥 骷髅岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cambodia, Mexico, Skull Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甚至在怀俄明州找到了一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We even found one in Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你们不杀了他们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you kill 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,政府想这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The government wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但艾玛和我相信有些巨兽是无害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Emma and I believe some are benevolent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不要自欺欺人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kid yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 嘿 看 我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Hey, look at that. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,暴徒堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Castle Bravo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是猛禽一号 请求进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is Raptor One. On direct approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽一号 准许降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raptor One, you are cleared
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请至四号升降台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for assisted descent to pad four.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,传感器设置为三米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensors set for three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,开始朝底层下降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beginning sub-surface descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是新设施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们称之为暴徒堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we call it Castle Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的新旗舰设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our new flagship facility
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,建在哥斯拉的地盘上 以便于研究和追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}built to track and study Godzilla on his own turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought he was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 只有你不知道它的行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, only if you don't know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如你们所知 大约在早上七点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, at approximately 0700 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们位于中国云南热带雨林的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our containment site
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁基地被袭击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in China's Yunnan Rainforest was raided.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,代号摩斯拉的物种逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The specimen, code name Mothra, escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,随后在附近的瀑布后方结茧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only to cocoon itself later under a nearby waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在艾玛拉塞尔博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While Doctor Emma Russell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,和她的女儿麦蒂森被劫持的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and her daughter Madison were taken hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是幕后男猪脚 艾伦乔纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the man responsible, Alan Jonah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一名前应该陆军上校 后来成了生态恐怖分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A former British army colonel turned ecoterrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,痴迷与重建自然法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obsessed with restoring natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为了资助他的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to fund his operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他开始在全新而危险的黑市走私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he began trafficking in a new and dangerous market.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Titan DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这种大蝴蝶能做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is someone gonna do with a giant worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈在逗我 马丁内斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding, Martinez?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啥都能干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can't you do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,制药 生物武器 食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pharmaceuticals, bioweapons, food...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 这星球上没有任何一个国家或公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, there isn't a country or a company on the planet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不想插手这些大家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that doesn't wanna get its hands on one of these suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,请记住 这只是一只幼虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember, this is just a larva.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还是个小宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,结茧之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After it cocoons,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她会羽化成其他东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something else is gonna crawl out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.01,0:19:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,更大更凶残的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something bigger, meaner...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这还说不定呢 不是吗 里克老头？ - 哦 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't know that, Rick. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧 小陈 你还太年轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait for it, Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的情报显示 乔纳想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our intel indicates that Jonah wants
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,活捉这个巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to capture this specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,活捉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味他的雇佣兵紧随在后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means that he and his mercs won't be far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,凌晨五点我们将发起联合行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 0500, we'll ship out to launch a joint operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.49,0:20:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是故意打断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来想声东击西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a duck hunt to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 马克 你咋不能让福斯特上校先说完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Mark, why don't we let Colonel Foster finish...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一个诱饵 调虎离山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A decoy. A diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他们已经有了艾玛和奥卡音频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, they've already got Emma and the ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们已经掌握了 他们何必只为一只奔波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would they want just this one when they've got the keys
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,回到你的魔法王国？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your entire magic kingdom of horrors back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他们是想你们去追摩斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that they want you to go after this Mothra
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这样他们就能专注于真正的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they can go after a real prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,更大的巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是他们抓走了第一只巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is not the first specimen they've captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们经验老道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know what they are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这不仅关系到巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not just a specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了还有我的前妻和女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got an ex-wife and a daughter out there,in case you forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没人会忘记 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No one has forgotten that, Mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 呃 还是得提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, uh, to remind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你被带来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were brought on here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了帮助跟踪奥卡并给我们建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to help track the ORCA, and to advise us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你们杀掉这些怪兽 所有的怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I advise you to kill these things. All of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想确定这些东西不落入坏人手里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna make sure these things don't fall into the wrong hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们杀了他们 那奥卡就没用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill them and the ORCA's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,老弟 你老婆艾玛不会希望是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma wouldn't have wanted that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是为了救她的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even to save her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这不是第一次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it wouldn't be the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她把工作放在自己之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma put all of this before herself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至是家庭 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or her family, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这老哥挺讨厌泰坦呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude hates Titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 如果你是他 你也会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you would too, if you were him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,32号基地 这里是猛禽五号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outpost 32, this is Raptor Five,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,载运增援和补给物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on approach with reinforcements and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,请求允许降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Requesting permission to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽要求所有基地都处于高度戒备状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serizawa has all sites on high alert,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以请发送紧急代码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so transmitting emergency codes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 猛禽五号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, Raptor Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,密码正确 欢迎返航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Codes are good. Nice to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 需要帮忙卸货吗 - 谢了 我们自己可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Need a hand with offload? - No, we're good
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.91,0:22:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把它放在五号湾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna put it over at bay five.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟着我 - 回去吧 嘿 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Follow me - Go back up Hey, hey
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别管了 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave them, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.95,0:22:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我也怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.51,0:22:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,目视前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我们之前说的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.69,0:23:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,圣母玛丽亚呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,圣母可没有这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,零号怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monster Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.89,0:24:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有幸存者吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.53,0:24:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 他们想送出紧急信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. They tried to launch an emergency beacon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们及时切断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we cut them off in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们迟早会发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.10,0:24:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,开始打洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire up the drills.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,东西备齐了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have everything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 那我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.98,0:24:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Further.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.23,0:24:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在面临着来自灰熊的严峻形势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a grizzly situation up here in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.11,0:24:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 安德鲁 安德鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andrew. Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.51,0:24:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吃你的马啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to eat your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.11,0:24:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不能吃我的马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't eat my horses...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.51,0:24:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有入侵者 抓住她 - 抓住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An intruder. Get her - Get her
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.75,0:25:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住她 抓住她 - 不 别抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get her Get her - No, don't get me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁 麦蒂森 抓住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrew, Madison Get her
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.22,0:25:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住她 - 灰熊之吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get her - Bear kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.69,0:25:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,灰熊之吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bear kisses
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员进入战斗位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, report to battle stations. Code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.77,0:25:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员进入战斗位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, report to battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.47,0:25:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 红色警戒 - 至少60节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Code red. - At least 60 knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.61,0:25:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.15,0:25:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员进入战斗位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, report to battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.08,0:25:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.52,0:25:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.75,0:25:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,出了点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.05,0:25:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他之前从未如此接近过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's never been this close before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.96,0:25:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？ - 你说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's he? - Who do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他在摧毁我们的无人机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking out our observation drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,行进方向？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trajectory?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,直奔我们来了 200米迫近中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight at us 1,200 meters and closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.70,0:25:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,G小队 巴恩斯 马丁内斯 亨德里克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}G-Team. Barnes, Martinez, Hendricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,立即进入远端武器控制台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you on those CROWS now
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.44,0:25:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听清楚老大的话了吧 麻溜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard boss lady Let's move
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦顿博士 你有他的生物声学吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Stanton. Do you have his bioacoustics?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.09,0:26:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,生物声学马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Acoustics coming up
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.19,0:26:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 他越来越近了 距离800米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, he's closing. We're at 800 meters
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.39,0:26:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,行进路线飘忽不定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its movements are erratic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.03,0:26:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,心跳和呼吸加速了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heart and breathing elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.59,0:26:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他肯定对什么事很不爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's definitely not happy about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.06,0:26:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么得到这些的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are they getting all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛分离出哥斯拉生物声学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma isolated Godzilla's bioacoustics.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.03,0:26:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们能追踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It allows us to track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至读取它的生命指数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even to get his vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他绕着我们游 迫近中 200米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circling now, closing in, 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.81,0:26:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.25,0:26:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人就位 武器准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All teams in position, weapons hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.01,0:26:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等我下令开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ready to engage on my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.72,0:26:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.79,0:26:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道他会不会攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know he'll attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.72,0:26:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们继续用枪指着他的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will if you keep those guns on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.33,0:26:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我比任何人都想他死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I want him dead more than anybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你们没有胜算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but unless this is a fight that you know that you can win,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.36,0:26:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看在上帝的面子上 解除装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for God's sake, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.97,0:27:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,解除装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.41,0:27:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是认真的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.91,0:27:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.08,0:27:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,解除戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,解除戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍 收起武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say again, safe your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.28,0:27:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不要开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他的心跳放缓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His heart rate, it's slowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,打开防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.64,0:27:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 当然 让我们带她进来喝杯啤酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, sure. Let's bring him in for a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你脑袋进水了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You out of your goddamn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.21,0:27:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,让他知道我们不是威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him know we're not a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,打开防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.55,0:27:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,打开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 那光闪闪是咋回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's with the light show?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.42,0:28:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他在向我们示威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an intimidation display.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.49,0:28:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就像大猩猩捶胸顿足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a gorilla pounding his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.13,0:28:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 我们都快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider us very
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.16,0:28:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,被闪尿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}intimidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.37,0:28:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他的目标不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.21,0:28:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.77,0:29:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 刚才真是有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.54,0:29:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.32,0:29:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在能关防护罩了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we maybe close the shield now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.63,0:29:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看他的地盘线路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me his territorial routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.23,0:29:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啥？咋了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.76,0:29:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想开发新的航行线路 赶紧给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I wanna start a boat tour. Just show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.66,0:29:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我们你在找什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You care to tell us what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.87,0:29:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,当动物离开狩猎场时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When an animal leaves its hunting ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.80,0:29:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,通常是因为它收到某些东西的威胁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's usually because it's threatened by something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.84,0:29:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快做路径预测图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run a course projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.31,0:29:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去追他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.81,0:29:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在找一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's looking for something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.85,0:29:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那可能是奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be the ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.85,0:30:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦顿博士 预测结果是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Stanton, what's your projection?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.59,0:30:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所有可能路径都通往同一个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All paths have him landing in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.39,0:30:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,南极洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antarctica.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.66,0:30:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.03,0:30:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我们走吧我们去找他吧 让我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, let's go Let's go find him. Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.10,0:30:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 南极洲有什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what's in Antarctica?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.07,0:30:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barnes,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.17,0:30:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,联系亚果号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}contact the Argo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.37,0:30:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.85,0:30:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方的物体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The specimen at this site
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.92,0:30:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一直被官方保密未登录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been kept entirely off-book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.82,0:30:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而且最近才出土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since it's a more recent discovery,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.12,0:30:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们数据有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our data is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.39,0:30:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但他似乎是另一个顶级掠食者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it seems to be another apex predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛叫他零号巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma called it Monster Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.70,0:30:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能是哥斯拉的劲敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may have been a rival alpha to Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.06,0:30:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,争夺其它泰坦巨兽的统治地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battling for dominance over the other Titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.90,0:30:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,陈博士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Chen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.37,0:30:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在努力查找几千年来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been scouring through thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.94,0:30:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,神话和传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of myths and legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.47,0:30:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但人们好像害怕到不敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's almost as if people were scared
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.08,0:30:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,去记录下他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to even write about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.64,0:31:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,仿佛他本该被遗忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if it was meant to be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.25,0:31:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思打断一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I hate to crash a party,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.45,0:31:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到了一些坏消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I got some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以直接说消息 反正都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could just say news. It's always bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.35,0:31:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.75,0:31:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他在委内瑞拉附近失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He dropped off the scan near Venezuela.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.79,0:31:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dropped off?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不说 布鲁克斯博士是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, Doctor Brooks was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,地球是空心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他才能迅速移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how he moves around so fast
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.43,0:31:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,用像虫洞一样的水下隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}using these underwater tunnels like wormholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.60,0:31:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,四处游走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just zippin' around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大家注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone look sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在接近基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're approaching the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.88,0:31:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 - 拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're here. - Keep 'em busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.78,0:31:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,发动反动力 搬出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch reaction force. Move out
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.85,0:31:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 出发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, gents Got the green light
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.84,0:32:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果乔纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Jonah is looking
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.11,0:32:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想要窃取基因样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to extract genetic samples
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.44,0:32:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们将去生物实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll be here in the bio labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.78,0:32:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,检查你们的设备 靠门站好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check your equipment, stand by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.23,0:32:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,艾什 你动作快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Ash. Make it snappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.34,0:32:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 引爆器已连接 - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Detonator ready. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.31,0:32:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 麦蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.64,0:32:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move Move
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.96,0:32:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 睁大眼睛 里面有自己人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, eyes wide. We got friendlies in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.93,0:33:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,进入二号隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move to tunnel two.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.70,0:33:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,提供掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on overwatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.37,0:33:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.79,0:33:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伏击 伏击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambush Ambush
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.73,0:33:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小队遇到袭击 伤亡严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Team under fire 360 ambush
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在遭受重创\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking heavy losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.26,0:33:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,向右突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break right
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.77,0:33:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,停火 停火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire Hold your fire
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.07,0:33:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有自己人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got friendlies
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.14,0:33:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,马克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.21,0:33:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去帮巴恩斯 我去追他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down there and help Barnes. I'm going after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.21,0:33:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.56,0:34:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我收到了心电图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. I'm getting an EKG reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.30,0:34:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.24,0:34:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,麦蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maddie
