Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.53,0:34:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马克 - 艾玛 麦迪森 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark. - Emma, Madison, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.33,0:34:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.54,0:34:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.90,0:34:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾玛 麦蒂 我们走 - 爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emma, Maddie, come on. - Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.07,0:34:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森 朝我这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison, walk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.71,0:34:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧 来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk to me now. Come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.34,0:34:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,巴恩斯 有两个人质 已击杀一个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barnes, I've got two hostages, one target down.
