Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.41,0:34:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 我无法锁定目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, I do not have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.81,0:34:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛 你在干嘛？我们走吧 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma, what are you doing? Let's go. Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.52,0:35:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 麦蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad. - Maddie.
