Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.30,0:36:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.44,0:37:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快 我们走 快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go Strap in
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.34,0:37:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间一项项检查了 检查间隙是否清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No checklist this time. Check clearance right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.64,0:37:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.08,0:37:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸来这做什么? - 我不知道 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is Dad doing here? - I don't know, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.98,0:37:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你在等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.79,0:37:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快唤醒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.67,0:37:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go Move it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.56,0:38:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈在逗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be fucking kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.14,0:39:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back Fall back
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.21,0:39:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,上直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the chopper
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.98,0:39:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.65,0:39:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open fire
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.80,0:39:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将以最大转速垂直齐飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do an emergency vertical take-off at max RPM.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.87,0:39:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,二号螺旋桨仍在加速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number two's still speeding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.78,0:40:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.14,0:40:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽一号呼叫亚果号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Raptor One to Argo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.91,0:40:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请求立即撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Requesting immediate urgent extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.98,0:40:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 紧急撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again, I say urgent extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.85,0:40:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,格里芬 快让我们离开这鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Griffin, get us the hell out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.75,0:40:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.35,0:40:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison, no
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放手吧 - 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need to let go of it - No No No
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦迪森 - 麦迪森 松手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Madison - Maddie Let go
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.80,0:40:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.67,0:41:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亚果号 这里是猛禽一号 我们收到了攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argo, this is Raptor One. We've been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.90,0:41:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所有系统失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.87,0:41:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.72,0:42:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.04,0:43:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快出去 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, clear out. Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go Go
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.52,0:43:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马克 - 我被卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark - I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.21,0:43:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.41,0:43:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了 我搞定了 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it I got it. Go, go
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.15,0:45:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星上有什么踪影吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything on the satellites?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.62,0:45:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,潜艇看到哥斯拉朝阿根廷移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subs have Godzilla hauling ass off Argentina.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.52,0:45:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在巴西的热带风暴中跟丢了零号巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost Monster Zero in a tropical storm over Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.79,0:45:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,扫描整个南半球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning the entire Southern Hemisphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.96,0:45:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,目前为止一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那就扫描北半球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then scan the Northern.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.43,0:45:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.66,0:45:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我看到了什么 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I saw, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.27,0:45:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 她按下了那个扳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm telling you, she pulled that trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.50,0:45:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 上校 你看错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All due respect, Colonel, you saw wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.34,0:45:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗? 她不会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? She wouldn't have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 这屋子里的所有人都是她雇来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ, she recruited pretty much everyone in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.41,0:45:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是乔纳强迫她的 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Jonah forced her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.54,0:46:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他用麦迪森挟持她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he used Madison as leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.48,0:46:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 肯定是别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. It had to be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.08,0:46:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.72,0:46:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是艾玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.25,0:46:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,福斯特没看错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foster saw it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.82,0:46:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是她 没人强迫她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was her. No one forced her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.69,0:46:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.63,0:46:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 她释放了摩斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, she releases Mothra.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.80,0:46:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是零号巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Monster Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有人看出其中的关联吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else sensing a pattern here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.67,0:46:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有 并且情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and not a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.37,0:46:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她好像要唤醒所有的怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as if she is trying to start a mass awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.47,0:46:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真糟糕 没人警告你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's just too bad that no one tried
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.81,0:46:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,会有惨剧发生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to warn you that that was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.48,0:46:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.94,0:46:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她为什么要释放怪兽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell would she want to release them?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.15,0:46:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么她会和乔纳合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why would she team up with Jonah,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.78,0:46:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of all people, to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.78,0:46:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会问她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll ask her
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.88,0:46:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.92,0:46:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们继续找吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.64,0:47:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哥斯拉的行进路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godzilla appears to be following
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.47,0:47:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,与艾玛的直升机相同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the same path as Emma's osprey,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.07,0:47:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,越过南美洲朝北到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heading north over South America to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.84,0:47:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,墨西哥马拉岛的56号基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outpost 56 in Isla de Mara, Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.58,0:47:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将在十分钟内抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We touch down there in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.75,0:47:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.12,0:47:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.65,0:47:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人们 在村子里的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people. The people down there in that village
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.25,0:47:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that don't realize they're gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.89,0:47:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会成为当天的特餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the special of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.26,0:47:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们派了G小队去疏散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've sent G-Team to begin an evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.16,0:47:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Serizawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.46,0:47:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在紧急频道上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a call on the emergency channel
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.03,0:47:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,接到一个来自马拉岛的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Isla de Mara.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.13,0:47:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,接进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.74,0:47:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜我应该先说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose I should go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.21,0:47:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.14,0:47:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她就在我身边 - 爸爸 你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's right here with me. - Dad, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.45,0:47:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison, you all right, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.78,0:47:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.12,0:47:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.25,0:47:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.45,0:47:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.82,0:47:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.09,0:47:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她很好 马克 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's fine, Mark, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.69,0:47:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,信任你有点难啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust is a little hard
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.19,0:47:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拉塞尔博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come by, Doctor Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.53,0:47:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是在你摆了大家一道之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially after what you pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.13,0:47:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.60,0:48:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能想象你们在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can only imagine what you're all thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.10,0:48:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果有其它方法 我也不会出此下策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if there were any other way to do this, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.91,0:48:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛 艾玛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what, Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.41,0:48:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我在拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.04,0:48:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,通过释放怪兽吗？放你的狗屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But by releasing those things? That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.71,0:48:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管看起来不大可能 但确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As impossible as it seems, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.15,0:48:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear me out, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.12,0:48:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们失去安德鲁后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After we lost Andrew,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.82,0:48:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓他的牺牲不会白费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swore his death would not be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.75,0:48:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I would find an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.12,0:48:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,关于泰坦回归的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A solution to why the Titans were rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.49,0:48:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但当我深入挖掘后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as I dug deeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.03,0:48:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我意识到他们来这里是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I realized that they were here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.30,0:48:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管这些年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that despite all the years
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.73,0:48:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们努力试图阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we spent trying to stop them,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.10,0:48:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从不敢面对真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we never dared to confront the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.47,0:48:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么真相？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.31,0:48:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,数千年来 人类一直霸占地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans have been the dominant species for thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.58,0:48:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and look what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.18,0:48:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,人口过剩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overpopulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.45,0:48:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,污染 战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pollution, war.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.68,0:48:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们担心的大规模灭绝已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mass extinction we feared has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.19,0:49:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正是元凶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we are the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.33,0:49:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是感染源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.03,0:49:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但向所有生物一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But like all living organisms,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.10,0:49:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,地球使用了防御机制来对抗这种感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the earth unleashed a fever to fight this infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.50,0:49:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,最原始最合法的规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its original and rightful rulers,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.54,0:49:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.21,0:49:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是地球自然防御系统的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are part of the earth's natural defense system.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.38,0:49:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,用于保护地球 维持平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A way to protect the planet, to maintain its balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.65,0:49:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果政府封锁 摧毁他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if governments are allowed to contain them, destroy them,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.79,0:49:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,或将他们用于战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or use them for war,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.79,0:49:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的感染只会继续蔓延\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the human infection will only continue to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.92,0:49:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们有生之年 我们的星球会灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And within our lifetime, our planet will perish,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.00,0:49:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也将灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们恢复平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless we restore balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.70,0:49:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你这样做会留下什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's gonna be left, if you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.24,0:49:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一个被怪物蹂躏的死寂焦土？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dead, charred world, overrun by monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.97,0:49:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 斯坦顿博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Doctor Stanton,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.34,0:49:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.01,0:49:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就像森林大火能滋润土壤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like how a forest fire replenishes the soil
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.91,0:49:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,或是火山能创造新的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or how a volcano creates new land,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:50:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,迹象显示 怪兽也能带来如此荣景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have seen signs that these creatures will do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.25,0:50:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,旧金山 拉斯维加斯 无论泰坦去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}San Francisco, Las Vegas, wherever the Titans go,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.09,0:50:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,生命力因辐射激发而绽放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}life follows, triggered by their radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.79,0:50:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are the only thing that can reverse
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.96,0:50:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,才能修复我们所造成的破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the destruction that we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.83,0:50:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是生命延续的唯一保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are the only guarantee that life will carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.97,0:50:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但要实现这点 我必须让他们自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for that to happen, we must set them free.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.20,0:50:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在谋杀这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are murdering the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.97,0:50:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.21,0:50:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,即便前路艰辛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because as difficult as this will be,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.31,0:50:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证人类不会灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise humanity will not go extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.21,0:50:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,使用奥卡 我们将回归自然秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using the ORCA, we will return to a natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.82,0:50:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在被遗忘的秩序中 与泰坦巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A forgotten order, where we coexisted
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.35,0:50:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,地球上的第一批神祗 和谐共存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in balance with the Titans.The first gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.06,0:50:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这是条危险的道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a dangerous path.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.69,0:50:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你意图操纵人类未知的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are meddling with forces beyond our comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.93,0:50:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,拿几十亿人的性命做赌注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gambling with the lives of billions
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你何尝不是在赌博 芹泽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are you gambling with, Serizawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.30,0:50:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,帝王组织已破裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monarch is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.00,0:50:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,政府将强制关闭帝王计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the verge of being shut down by a government
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.97,0:50:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,并一致决定消灭这些怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose only objective is to eradicate the creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.41,0:50:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果发生这种情况 我们的希望在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if that happens, what will our chances be?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.44,0:51:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的是脑子坏掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are out of your goddamn mind
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.21,0:51:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 你把我们的女儿置于危险之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you put our daughter's life in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.08,0:51:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在又开始决定世界的命运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now you get to decide the fate of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.81,0:51:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是胡闹 艾玛 - 我头脑非常清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's rich, Emma - I couldn't be more sane,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.32,0:51:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森也很坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Madison couldn't be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.52,0:51:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们失去安德鲁后 我训练她如何自保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After we lost Andrew, I trained her to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.49,0:51:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,至少现在她努力就会有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And at least now, she will have a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,努力就有机会？你在炖什么毒鸡汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fighting chance? Why don't you listen to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.89,0:51:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这不仅仅是数学公式 艾玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not all math, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.06,0:51:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有的东西你无法控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things, you can't control.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.90,0:51:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有的事你无法逃避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there are some things that you can't run from.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.97,0:51:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这不会让他回到我们身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't bring him back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.79,0:51:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能敦促大家避难吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only urge you all to take refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.66,0:51:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在过去的60年里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the last 60 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.26,0:51:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,帝王组织在世界各地准备了底下堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monarch has prepared bunkers around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.93,0:51:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,用以拯救并重启文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save and restart civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.56,0:51:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你们找到它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.74,0:52:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,臭婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.07,0:52:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还有多久降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until this thing lands?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.58,0:52:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,三分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.91,0:52:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你可以重新考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to rethink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.48,0:52:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.85,0:52:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不对劲 看下这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's not right. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.75,0:52:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛不在马拉岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma's not at Isla de Mara.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.05,0:52:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是信号太弱 根本不在当地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the signal's too weak to be local.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.72,0:52:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她正在用我们的卫星传输信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's bouncing it off our satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.49,0:52:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定藏在某个旧碉堡里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be holed up in one of our old bunkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.89,0:52:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.69,0:52:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.23,0:52:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 我的天 她把封锁系统关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus She shut down the containment system.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有多少时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much time do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.90,0:52:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,解除封锁并骇入扩音系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Containment system bypassed. We're patched in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.37,0:52:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 准备播放奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hmm. - Ready to broadcast the ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.41,0:52:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.39,0:52:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, don't
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.99,0:52:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 所以一个小孩来指点江山了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, did a child just tell you what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.09,0:52:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,也许爸爸是对的 也许不该这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Dad is right. Maybe this isn't the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.83,0:53:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 拉塞尔博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all means, Doctor Russell,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.53,0:53:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们重新考虑整个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's reconsider our entire plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.10,0:53:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是在通知了你的朋友后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially after telling your friends about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.80,0:53:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森 我们已经谈过这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison, we talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.64,0:53:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你说你会帮助大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you said you were gonna help people,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.10,0:53:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你会先让他们找到庇护所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you would let them find shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.54,0:53:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have time for this
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.88,0:53:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你真觉得这会很容易吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you really think this was gonna be easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.81,0:53:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不痛不痒？ 你是这么告诉她的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Painless? Is that what you told her?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.41,0:53:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别把她扯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave her out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.91,0:53:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？难道不是你把她扯进来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? You're the one who pulled her into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.58,0:53:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森 告诉我 你妈是怎么说服你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison, tell me, what exactly did Mommy sell you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.62,0:53:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,乌托邦的故事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some grand utopia?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.12,0:53:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,人与巨兽和谐共存？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man and monster, living together
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.99,0:53:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一起快乐生活？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in blissful harmony?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.52,0:53:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 他们试图防堵我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, they're attempting to lock us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.83,0:53:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,再不动手来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.23,0:53:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛 你来找我 告诉我这是你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma, you came to me. This is your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.90,0:53:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都想拯救地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both want to save the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果不彻底执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but everything is going to die
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.07,0:53:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we don't see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.10,0:53:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 至少让他们安全逃离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, at least let them get to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.71,0:53:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 我们的机窗口正在关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, our window's closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.52,0:53:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.92,0:53:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 麦迪森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.69,0:54:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这比你我更重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bigger than just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.22,0:54:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们慢慢来 别挤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to slow it down
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.82,0:54:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们站回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to stand back
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.36,0:54:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,走开 别挡道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move Get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.05,0:55:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,疏散人群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear, men
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.86,0:55:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个有什么响亮的称号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a catchy name for this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.96,0:55:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当地传说称其为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Local legends call it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.66,0:55:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,炎魔拉顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodan, the fire demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.37,0:55:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来真是让人欣慰啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.60,0:55:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.97,0:55:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们记得那热带风暴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember that tropical storm
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.74,0:55:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,害我们追丢零号巨兽的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we lost Monster Zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.01,0:55:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,它正在改变方向 并且 额\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's changing direction and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.84,0:56:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,猜猜它现在朝哪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guess where it's headed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.35,0:56:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.38,0:56:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没有风暴能移动的这么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No storm moves that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.21,0:56:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,除非那不是风暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless it's not a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 我们需要时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, man - We need time
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.62,0:56:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来完成疏散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to finish the evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.89,0:56:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你们最好快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you'd better hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.06,0:56:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它正在快速接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause it's closing in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.26,0:56:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽 这不是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serizawa, it's not a coincidence
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.46,0:56:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,零号朝这来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Monster Zero thing is headed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.46,0:56:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他在响应大火鸟的呼叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's reacting to Big Bird's cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.20,0:56:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着他不是来觅食 干架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means it's coming for food, a fight, or a...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.30,0:56:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,某些更亲密的需求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something more intimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.70,0:56:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么建议?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.21,0:56:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所有战机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All fighters,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.71,0:56:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,自由开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weapons free.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.40,0:56:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我想我们引起了他的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I think we got his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.03,0:56:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大家系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone strap in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.73,0:57:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,全体机队 跟着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All ships, follow our lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.91,0:57:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.77,0:57:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.08,0:57:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be okay
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.85,0:57:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, kid
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.83,0:58:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,亚果号呼叫黄金中队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argo to Gold Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.33,0:58:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把大火鸡引进陆地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's lure this turkey away from the mainland
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.67,0:58:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,朝零号飞去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}straight to Monster Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.80,0:58:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,预计两分钟抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ETA two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.07,0:58:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,黄金中队 在后方直接开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold Squadron, engage on our six.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.90,0:58:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 开始倒计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy. Start the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.59,0:58:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大火鸟在高处九点钟方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bogey. Nine o'clock high
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.00,0:58:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,达斯特223\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duster 223.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.77,0:58:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他在你后面 快闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there. He's on your tail Get out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.25,0:58:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇座机坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cobra's Raptor is off the team
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.88,0:58:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,预计六十秒后与零号接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ETA to Monster Zero, 60 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.58,0:58:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽37\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raptor 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.82,0:58:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大火鸟在你正后方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bogey coming up on your six.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.13,0:59:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我在失去控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.27,0:59:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我在失去控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing control
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.97,0:59:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,机队全灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost the squadron
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.88,0:59:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,30秒后与怪兽零号交汇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ETA to Monster Zero, 30 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.76,0:59:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,10秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.22,1:00:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,下潜 下潜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dive Dive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.01,1:00:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 他们在自相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, they're killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.78,1:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,求救求救猛禽一号呼叫亚果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday, mayday This is Raptor One to Argo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.02,1:00:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,亚果 收到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argo, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.75,1:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, Raptor One. What's your status?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.42,1:00:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're screwed, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.15,1:00:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有孩子在飞机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we got kids on board.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.56,1:00:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要立即进行空中救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need immediate mid-air retrieval.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.29,1:00:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定他们的位置 并准备停机坪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock on to their position, and prepare the hangar
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.69,1:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,准备紧急着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for an emergency landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.33,1:00:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,停机坪舱门没有回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hangar doors are unresponsive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.56,1:00:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 手动控制呢？ - 卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manual override? - They're stuck
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.53,1:00:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 停机坪在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, which way to the hangar?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.83,1:00:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.97,1:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.60,1:00:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道在哪 我 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the way. I... Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.17,1:00:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你的工具给力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you got a big wrench.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.95,1:01:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.82,1:01:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,液压系统卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydraulics systems are jammed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.22,1:01:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我正尝试跨接启动电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to jump-start power.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.99,1:01:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not looking good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.76,1:01:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是海军上将滕兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Admiral Stenz.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.93,1:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.60,1:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,博士 芹泽 福斯特上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Serizawa, Colonel Foster.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.44,1:01:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你和你的部队立即撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you and your forces to immediately disengage
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.21,1:01:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,撤回至安全距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and withdraw to a safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.97,1:01:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上将 我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.11,1:01:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直在开发新武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been developing a prototype for a new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.95,1:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,水中氧气破坏剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An oxygen destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.65,1:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,能消灭两公里范围内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Designed to exterminate all life forms
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.85,1:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within a two-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.39,1:01:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,运气好的话 能杀死这些巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With any luck, it will kill these things
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.35,1:01:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这场噩梦将结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this nightmare will finally be over.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.72,1:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,上将 我们必须对哥斯拉有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, we must keep our faith in Gojira.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.52,1:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起博士 你们机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Doctor. You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.20,1:01:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹已经在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The missile is already on its way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.56,1:01:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,愿上帝垂怜我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God have mercy on us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.33,1:02:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.14,1:02:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹全速袭来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming in hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.94,1:02:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,亚果 现在就得打开舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argo, you gotta get those bay doors open now
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.31,1:02:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,叫救护和消防队就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the crash and fire crews ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.48,1:02:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你特么在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.69,1:02:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.50,1:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.53,1:02:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 格里夫 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Griff Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.57,1:02:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,撞他 撞他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it Hit it
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.79,1:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机就得这么开 格里夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about, Griff
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.62,1:02:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大家还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.89,1:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,到停机坪后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over to the back of the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.66,1:02:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大家往这走 这里这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna head this way. This way. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.33,1:03:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你载我一程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the lift
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.16,1:03:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go Go
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.80,1:03:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.33,1:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.56,1:03:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,军方发射了新武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The military launched a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.16,1:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,会杀死他们两\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna kill 'em both.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.37,1:03:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,恩 这主意不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's not the worst idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.01,1:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.58,1:03:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nine,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.01,1:03:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}eight,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.58,1:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.23,1:04:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.98,1:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.84,1:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦顿博士 你们找到哥斯拉的位置吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Stanton, can you locate Gojira?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.12,1:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我发现了些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.65,1:05:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他的生命指数在衰减 辐射值在直线下降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His vitals are fading. Radiation levels plummeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.43,1:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 大家伙 干他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, big guy. Fight it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.97,1:05:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.74,1:05:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,马克 你的愿望达成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you got your wish, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.06,1:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们是逐次释放他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were going to release them gradually.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.10,1:07:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一次一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.47,1:07:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the one doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.61,1:07:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,吾皇万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.19,1:07:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.87,1:07:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,暴徒堡 这里是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Castle Bravo, this is
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.61,1:07:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁小组莫苏拉 能收到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Containment Team Mosura. Do you read? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.61,1:07:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,暴徒堡这里是封锁小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Castle Bravo, this is Containment Team.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.14,1:07:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.21,1:07:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.58,1:07:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是去了与亚果号的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost contact with the Argo,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.15,1:07:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有暴徒堡和其他基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Castle Bravo and the other containment sites.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.15,1:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吴哥窟 骷髅岛 石山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angkor Wat, Skull Island, Stone Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.45,1:07:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的泰坦巨兽都逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the Titans, they're escaping.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.12,1:07:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 这可能是我们最后的通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, this may be our last comm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.29,1:08:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.03,1:08:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 这是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's... It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.60,1:08:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.43,1:08:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在回应他的号召\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're responding to his call.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.90,1:08:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 凌博士在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God Where's Doctor Ling?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.37,1:08:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.38,1:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,凌博士 我们失去了与帝王组织的联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Ling We've lost contact with Monarch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.05,1:08:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,凌博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Ling?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.22,1:09:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦迪森 等等 - 离我远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Madison, wait - Get away from me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.22,1:09:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道事情还没结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know things haven't gone
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.92,1:09:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不如预期 但我可以补救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exactly according to plan, but I can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.39,1:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不如预期?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.73,1:09:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你会小心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that you were gonna be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.10,1:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你一次释放一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you'd release them one at a time,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.46,1:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你会恢复自然的平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you would restore balance
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.70,1:09:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,政府将要接管帝王组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were gonna take over Monarch
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.17,1:09:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,并杀光泰坦 我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kill the Titans. I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.70,1:09:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,放狗屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.84,1:09:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们这么做是为了安德鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we were doing this for Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.65,1:10:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你真觉得他会想要这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think he would've wanted this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.93,1:10:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.93,1:10:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.04,1:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,麦迪森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.95,1:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有头绪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.35,1:10:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.25,1:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不管艾玛用什么做出这个音频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever Emma used to create the ORCA signal,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.82,1:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我没听过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never heard it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.42,1:10:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.39,1:10:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你说啥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.70,1:10:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"神话是我们的指南针 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Myth is our compass."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.23,1:10:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我母亲常说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something my mom used to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.33,1:10:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她相信我们关于怪兽和龙的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She believed our stories about monsters and dragons
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.04,1:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮助我们找到泰坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could help us find the Titans
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.14,1:11:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,并恢复我们与自然的连接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and restore our connection to nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.01,1:11:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你母亲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, your mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.51,1:11:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是第二代帝王组织成员？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're second-generation Monarch?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.11,1:11:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,第三代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.75,1:11:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是家族遗传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.02,1:11:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.78,1:11:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你家人不会有什么屠龙秘方吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose your family has any tips on slaying dragons, do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.45,1:11:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,屠龙是西方的概念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slaying dragons is a Western concept.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.19,1:11:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在东方 龙是神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the East, they are sacred.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.19,1:11:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这些神兽会带来智慧和力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divine creatures who brought wisdom, strength,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.13,1:11:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至是救赎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even redemption.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.53,1:11:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这操蛋的水中氧气破坏剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This oxygen destroyer,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.80,1:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么对零号没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why wasn't Monster Zero affected?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.10,1:11:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm no scientist,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.41,1:11:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think it has something to do
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.94,1:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,和他的头能再生有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with his goddamn head growing back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.27,1:11:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧我之前从未见过这种特异功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.04,1:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,违反所有已知的自然法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It violates everything we know about the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.55,1:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,除非他不是自然的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless he's not part of the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.45,1:11:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.75,1:11:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我拼凑出这些资讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was able to piece this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.39,1:11:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来好面熟啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he looks vaguely familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.29,1:11:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这讲述了一条伟大的龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tells of a great dragon
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.36,1:11:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,从星空掉落凡间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who fell from the stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.96,1:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一种九头蛇圈起的风暴吞噬了人来和终神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Hydra whose storm swallowed both men and gods alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.50,1:11:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你的意思是外星生物?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you mean an alien?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.00,1:11:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他不属于我们自然界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. He's not part of our natural order.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.60,1:12:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他本不该在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's not meant to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.47,1:12:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,冒牌的王者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A false king.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.07,1:12:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,外来物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An invasive species.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.77,1:12:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这可以解释他为什么能卷起大风暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could explain how he's creating these massive storms
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.34,1:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对其他泰坦巨兽产生影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the effect he's having on the other Titans.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.05,1:12:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎是随他心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost like he's reshaping the planet
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.81,1:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,重新打造地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to his own liking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.18,1:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这些传奇 怎么称呼他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These legends, what did they call him?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.82,1:12:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,基多拉 三头六臂的王者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghidorah. "The one who is many."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.79,1:12:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,基什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghi-what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.85,1:12:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她说 "娘炮 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said, "Gonorrhea."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.06,1:12:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁? - 基多拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Huh? - Ghidorah
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.52,1:12:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽博士 我们正在接近暴徒堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Serizawa, we're approaching Castle Bravo,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.26,1:12:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但你应该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's something you should see.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.23,1:12:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你没有邀请访客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm guessing you weren't expecting these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.01,1:12:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,莫斯科 伦敦 华盛顿特区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow, London, Washington, D.C.,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.38,1:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,全都遭受攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all under attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.14,1:12:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦巨兽在每个大陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On every continent, the Titans are triggering
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.38,1:12:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,引发地震 野火 海啸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}earthquakes, wildfires, tsunamis,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.35,1:12:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,以及我们尚未定名的大灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and disasters we don't even have names for yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.92,1:12:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如同以往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now as before, we have been trying to lure
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.46,1:12:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们试图用和物质引诱怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the creatures with nuclear materials,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.12,1:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但这次他们完全不为所动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they are not taking the bait this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.79,1:13:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的行为变得毫无章法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their behavior has become random.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.53,1:13:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,难以预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erratic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.00,1:13:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,随着战线拉长 兵力透支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with our forces spread desperately thin
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.47,1:13:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽们在全球畅行无阻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and these things roaming the globe unimpeded,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.57,1:13:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的选择和时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are running out of options
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.77,1:13:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也越来越少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.17,1:13:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你们有要补充的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, do you have something to add?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.71,1:13:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.84,1:13:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的行为既非毫无章法 更非难以预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their behavior is not random or erratic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.48,1:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,允许我插句嘴 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.58,1:13:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来虽然很神神道道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As amazing as this sounds,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.09,1:13:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们是集体动员 在狩猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're moving like a pack. They're hunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.32,1:13:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所有动物 从野狼到虎鲸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All packs, from wolves to killer whales,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.06,1:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都听命于一个领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they all respond directly to an alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.66,1:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而基多拉是新霸主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this Ghidorah is the new alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.33,1:13:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,其它怪兽只是听命行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all the other creatures are just doing his bidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.86,1:13:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是他意志的延伸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're an extension of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.30,1:13:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果阻止了他 就阻止了所有巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stop him, we stop them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.84,1:13:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有其他巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there another creature
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.17,1:13:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能和他匹敌吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might stand a chance against him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.57,1:13:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.31,1:13:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,基多拉和哥斯拉的敌对关系既古老又独特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghidorah and Gojira's rivalry was ancient and unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.15,1:13:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 所以我们杀了个唯一可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, so we killed our best shot
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.11,1:13:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能打败这家伙的打手？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at beating this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.92,1:13:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,乔纳 你没搞懂 这改变一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonah, you don't get it. This changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.89,1:13:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哥斯拉死后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Godzilla gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.32,1:13:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,零号不会领导各巨兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monster Zero isn't using the Titans
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.49,1:14:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,重建地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to restore the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.29,1:14:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他会利用他们来摧毁世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is using them to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.03,1:14:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是共存 这是毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't coexistence. This is extinction.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.33,1:14:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 当你舒舒服服坐在实验室时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, while you were sitting comfortably
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.66,1:14:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们花数十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in some laboratory,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.93,1:14:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,打了无数场肮脏的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've been fighting for decades in one dirty war after another.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.44,1:14:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼见过人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen human nature firsthand
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.47,1:14:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而我在这告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm here to tell you
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.54,1:14:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一切不会变更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it doesn't get any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.67,1:14:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只会越来越糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.01,1:14:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉零号怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm sorry that Monster Zero
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.41,1:14:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不如预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't exactly what we were expecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.35,1:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们打开了潘多拉宝盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we opened Pandora's Box and there's no closing it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.99,1:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,已无退路 或许还有其他方法呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.36,1:14:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 别傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.09,1:14:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如果再广播 只会暴露我们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You broadcast again, and you will expose us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.29,1:14:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这些生物像鲸鱼一样沟通 好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These creatures communicate like whales, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.66,1:14:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可听到数千英里的声呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can hear sonar for thousands of miles,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.20,1:14:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们派出小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so let's send a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.47,1:14:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,从芬威球场广播奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's broadcast the ORCA from Fenway.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.60,1:14:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那距离这里很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a few miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.31,1:14:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,利用体育场来放大信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use the stadium to amplify a signal
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.11,1:14:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这也许能阻止攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might stop these attacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.81,1:14:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,城市已进行疏散 会很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city's already being evacuated, so it'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.68,1:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.28,1:15:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会查处零号到底是何方神圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I'll figure out what the hell
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.85,1:15:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,并阻止它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monster Zero really is and try to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.92,1:15:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,帝王组织会先找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Monarch finds us?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.22,1:15:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你的朋友会很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure all your friends will be
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.72,1:15:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,与你重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very happy to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.12,1:15:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.92,1:15:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗？这不是我们想要的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? This isn't the world that we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.76,1:15:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你说过这世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seem to remember you telling me
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.39,1:15:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,本就属于他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the world always belonged to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.26,1:15:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是时候将世界交还他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it is time we gave it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.40,1:15:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.31,1:15:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,马克 等等 你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark, wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.71,1:15:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能坐以待毙 我得做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't just sit down there. I gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.55,1:15:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,比如?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.88,1:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比如去找我的女儿 - 怎么找?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like go find my daughter. - How?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.81,1:15:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.98,1:15:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我只剩她了 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the only thing I got left, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.69,1:15:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,当初我们没在她身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't there for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.06,1:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再让这种事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.39,1:15:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.57,1:17:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.27,1:17:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,摩斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mothra.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.41,1:17:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen of the Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.08,1:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你在录音吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you recording this, Stanton?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.28,1:17:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,全在录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I record everything now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.55,1:17:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.55,1:17:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这像首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a song.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.05,1:17:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌只有某个怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet there's only one thing
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.79,1:17:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,能听懂这首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that can understand this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.89,1:17:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.20,1:17:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,收到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.33,1:17:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,接收到回应 载入中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picking up a reply. Bringing it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.04,1:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.31,1:17:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以她和哥斯拉 他们是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, her and Godzilla, they're like...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.18,1:17:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是在谈恋爱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got a thing going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.55,1:17:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这有点乱 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's kind of messed up, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.49,1:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,两种不同物种间的共生关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Symbiotic relationships between two different species
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.22,1:17:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是啥奇闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aren't all that uncommon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.16,1:17:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你能追踪他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you track him?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.69,1:18:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 信号太弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Signal's too weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.26,1:18:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但也许她可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe she can.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.94,1:18:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有多少核弹头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many nukes do you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.77,1:18:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.71,1:18:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以帮助他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.48,1:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,华府上方的六级飓风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This category six hurricane over D.C.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.52,1:18:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就是王者基多拉的巢穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is where King Ghidorah is nesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.55,1:18:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这会是项结合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working with all four branches of the military,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.62,1:18:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,四大军种的联合行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this will be a joint operation
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.22,1:18:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,将其诱离本土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to lure it away from the mainland,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.63,1:18:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们有足够时间疏散群众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that we can continue evacuations long enough
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.30,1:18:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,并让潜艇小组完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for our submersible team to complete its mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.50,1:18:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这就是死马当活马医的任务 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this plan is what you would call a "long shot," right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.51,1:18:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这群书呆子带核弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do those nerds think they're gonna do
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.24,1:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,去海底干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down there with a bunch of nukes?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.94,1:18:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听说吗 格里芬?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't hear 'em, Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.54,1:18:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想把哥斯拉起死回生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanna bring Godzilla back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.69,1:19:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在海底时我们将转战别区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be out of range while you're down there,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.09,1:19:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但会有中队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a squadron will stay behind
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.66,1:19:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,守护你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep an eye out for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.92,1:19:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.29,1:19:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 鲍曼 下潜吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All righty, Bowman,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.59,1:19:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,开始下潜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's take her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.03,1:19:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,下潜 设定深度150米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dive the ship. Make depth 150.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.63,1:19:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.90,1:19:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.37,1:19:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.43,1:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.87,1:19:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,该换新表的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to get a new watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.47,1:19:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是安德鲁最喜欢的笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrew's favorite joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.64,1:19:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有人拿出表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never took that watch out of your pocket
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.68,1:19:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会这么问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without him asking that question.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.25,1:20:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,若你在五年前告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.45,1:20:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我会试图拯救杀儿凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be trying to save the thing that took my son,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.62,1:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只有靠他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that would be the only way
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.89,1:20:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,去拯救我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save the family I have left...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.19,1:20:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.43,1:20:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,治愈伤口的唯一方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only way to heal our wounds is to make peace
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.53,1:20:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就是与创造他们的恶魔谈和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the demons who created them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.83,1:20:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的相信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.37,1:20:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.97,1:20:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你在这的原因吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that why you are here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.74,1:20:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,马克 有些事超出了我们的理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are some things beyond our understanding, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.91,1:20:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须接受他们并向他们学习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must accept them and learn from them,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.82,1:20:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这些危机时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because these moments of crisis
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.79,1:20:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也是信仰的潜在时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are also potential moments of faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.82,1:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在那一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A time
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.06,1:20:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走到一起共度难关或是分崩离析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we either come together or fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.56,1:20:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大自然总有一种平衡自己的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nature always has a way of balancing itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.30,1:20:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only question is,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.07,1:20:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将扮演什么角色?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what part will we play?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.64,1:21:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你是即兴扯淡扯出来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just make that up?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.71,1:21:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.71,1:21:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前在幸运饼干上读到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read it in a fortune cookie once.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.28,1:21:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很长的饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A really long fortune cookie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.62,1:21:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,船况如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Status of the ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.96,1:21:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,遭遇某种漩涡 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some sort of vortex, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.49,1:21:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在拉我们下潜 1600英尺后撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dragging us. 1600 feet till impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.17,1:21:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,800英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}800 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.04,1:21:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,200英尺后撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency blow 200 feet
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.47,1:21:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hundred
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.17,1:21:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,二十五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-five
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.88,1:21:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,准备迎接撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace for impact
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.39,1:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,亚果 这是布罗迪号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argo, this is U.S.S. Brody
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.56,1:22:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在前往疏散途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}en route to evacuation perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.39,1:23:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,装备武器 随时准备与巨兽交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons hot. Ready to engage Titans on your command.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.83,1:23:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.97,1:23:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好像整个天空都是活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the whole sky's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.24,1:23:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,因为的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.37,1:23:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.65,1:23:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,报告状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Status report.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.01,1:23:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,无法确认位置 定位系统失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't fix our position. GPS is down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.82,1:23:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但惯性系统指出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But inertial says we're...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.12,1:23:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,启航后前进了966公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}600 miles from departure.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.99,1:23:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.12,1:23:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it, man
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.62,1:23:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这漩涡是通往地心空洞的隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vortex was a tunnel into the Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.79,1:23:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那些地底通道系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a subterranean tunnel system
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.03,1:23:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,贯穿整个地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that connects the entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.56,1:23:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我就知道我是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter. I knew I was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.86,1:23:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我告诉过你了 小陈 - 闭嘴 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you, Chen - Shut up, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.70,1:23:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一秒后紧急上浮向前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One second emergency blow forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.41,1:23:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.35,1:23:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,发射探测器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch probes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.53,1:24:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,范围 1 000 米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Range 1,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.20,1:24:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,相机没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.60,1:24:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,控制住范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holding range.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.97,1:24:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.38,1:24:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.08,1:24:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,向右平移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pan right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.10,1:24:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像埃及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.54,1:24:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或是罗马的文物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.91,1:24:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这些不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, this is something different.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.51,1:24:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这些 这些更古老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is... This is way older.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.99,1:25:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.03,1:25:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of the legends,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.63,1:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,和那些故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the stories,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.70,1:25:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they are true.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.94,1:25:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们真的是第一批神祗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They really were the first gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.11,1:25:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果土地和石头会说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only the earth and stones could speak,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.04,1:25:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,会诉说多么精彩的故事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the stories they could tell us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.38,1:25:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦顿博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Stanton,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.85,1:25:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有哥斯拉的踪迹吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any sign of Gojira?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.45,1:25:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有 探测器检测到微量的辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the probe is picking up a radioactive blob,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.38,1:25:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在山脊另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just past that ridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.25,1:25:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,设定航向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set a course.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.20,1:25:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.06,1:25:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,总统下令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martial law has now been instated
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.30,1:25:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,全面戒严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by order of the President.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.84,1:25:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,波士顿地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The greater Boston area
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.40,1:25:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现归军方管辖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is now under control of the U.S. Military.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.74,1:26:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,市民请前往邻近疏散中心报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All citizens to report to the nearest evacuation center
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.98,1:26:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,立即疏散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for immediate transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.84,1:26:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 所有市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, all citizens
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.21,1:26:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请前往疏散中心报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are to report to the nearest evacuation...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.08,1:26:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦巨兽引起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Massive storms and other disasters
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.92,1:26:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大型风暴和灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}triggered by the Titans
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.48,1:26:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,迫使数百万人逃离主要城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have forced millions to flee major cities.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.39,1:26:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,由于华府收到六级飓风重创\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with D.C. hit hard by a category six hurricane
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.92,1:26:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,让首都完全泡在水中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has left the capital completely flooded,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.29,1:26:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是人类史上最大的灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is the single greatest disaster in human history.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.30,1:26:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,救援搜救行动持续进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The grim search continues, as people around the world
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.83,1:26:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,全国民众仍努力在残骸中寻找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sift through the debris of leveled homes
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.40,1:26:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,希望找到失踪的亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the hope of finding missing loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.47,1:26:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这景象虽让人心碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And though this sight is heartbreaking,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.34,1:26:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但并非个例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is unfortunately nothing unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.67,1:26:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,全球各大城市都遭遇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cities around the globe have fallen
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.88,1:26:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,众人口中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the wake of what many are calling
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.58,1:26:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦崛起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The Rise of the Titans."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.55,1:26:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.49,1:26:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.99,1:26:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我还想繁衍后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I still wanna have kids one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.99,1:26:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不希望胜生出带鳍的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preferably without flippers.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.76,1:26:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,全面暂停 原地待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All stop. Hover the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.27,1:27:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.54,1:27:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,侦测到氧气 二氧化碳及甲烷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got O2, CO2, and methane.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.18,1:27:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,里面似乎有某种气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like there's some sort of air pocket in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.46,1:27:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.66,1:27:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那是哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.33,1:27:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 探测器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And goodnight, Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.73,1:27:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,返回最后一个画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up the last frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.10,1:27:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那里 辐射的源头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. The source of the radiation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.87,1:27:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他才回到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he returned here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.74,1:27:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他在进食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's feeding,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.61,1:27:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}regenerating.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.31,1:27:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is his home.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.38,1:27:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是靠这个才活了这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how he's survived for so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.48,1:27:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,始终在调整 进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always adapting, evolving.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.75,1:27:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太惊人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.99,1:27:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 它自己能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, dude's got this covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.66,1:27:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗? 它只需要睡一小会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? He just needs a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.42,1:27:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.53,1:27:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个过程可能需要数年时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This process could take years.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.53,1:28:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得按计划进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to proceed as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.16,1:28:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.23,1:28:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要发射核弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna launch a nuclear torpedo
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.67,1:28:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给大怪兽做心肺复苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to revive a giant monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.10,1:28:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这 这不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is... This is not like
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.90,1:28:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,发动抛锚汽车那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're just jump-starting a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.51,1:28:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有另一个难题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have another complication.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.21,1:28:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,武器系统在坠落中损毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our weapons systems were damaged during the crash.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.77,1:28:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没法发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.84,1:28:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法修复吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can it be repaired?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.71,1:28:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我想恐怕是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.41,1:28:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果进去里面设计时器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. What if we go inside, set a timer,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.98,1:28:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,手动引爆呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and blow up the warhead manually?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.65,1:28:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能的 就算没被高温烤死 辐射也会致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way. If the heat doesn't fry you, the radiation will.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.03,1:28:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.23,1:28:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你在讲什么鬼话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.83,1:28:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.60,1:28:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间争论了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time for debate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.57,1:28:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.15,1:29:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,亚果 我们弹药不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argo, we are red on ammo
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.02,1:29:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快坚持不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and low on fuel. We can't take much more of this
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.69,1:29:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 收到 尽量牵制他们一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, copy. Just hold them off as long as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.69,1:29:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,上校 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.79,1:29:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所有巨兽都停下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the Titans have stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.97,1:29:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们现在又着了什么魔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell has gotten into them now?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.64,1:29:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,目前所有攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does appear as if the attacks
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.84,1:29:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎都暂停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have ceased for the time being,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.51,1:29:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,全部巨兽在几分钟内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the creatures going from destructive to docile
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.52,1:29:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从大肆破坏转为温顺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.92,1:29:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道为何或其中缘由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, no one is sure how or why,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.02,1:29:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但这似乎在全球同步发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this seems to be happening simultaneously around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.36,1:29:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.23,1:29:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.36,1:29:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.23,1:29:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知谁有如此能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder who could have done this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.44,1:29:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,麦蒂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.88,1:30:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,麦蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.59,1:30:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次接触 你会开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First contact, you're gonna start
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.76,1:30:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,失去这种视力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}losing your long-range vision.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.69,1:30:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,进入氧气室后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you surface,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.99,1:30:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的运动技能会开始消退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your motor skills are gonna start to fade,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.39,1:30:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但我放了一个氦氧混合物在水箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I put a helioxed mixture in the tank,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.60,1:30:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该能帮你保持稳定一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which should help you stay stable a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.90,1:30:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是项荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an honor, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.75,1:30:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.92,1:30:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的笔记本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My notes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.36,1:30:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.70,1:30:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他为我们战 为我们死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fought for us, died for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.44,1:30:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他不但是我们可能和平共存的实证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not only proof that coexistence is possible,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.01,1:31:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,更是其中的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he is the key to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.08,1:31:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好他们 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of them, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.65,1:32:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍曼 全速返航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowman, take us out, fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.58,1:32:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.59,1:32:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他已脱离母船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.36,1:35:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.00,1:35:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍曼 发个求救型号给亚果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowman, send a distress message to the Argo.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.30,1:35:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.75,1:35:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有看到什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.99,1:36:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.49,1:37:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.90,1:37:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to find 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.07,1:37:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to find 'em
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.41,1:37:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让他以我们为傲 千万别搞砸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make him proud and not screw this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.91,1:37:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他是怎么 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.05,1:37:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,为救我们而牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By saving us.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.48,1:37:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆 现在情况怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, what've we got going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.85,1:37:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为艾玛在激活奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think Emma activated the ORCA
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.89,1:37:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在波士顿附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somewhere near Boston.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.95,1:37:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所以基多拉和哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Ghidorah and Godzilla
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.35,1:37:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,才会同时朝那去里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are both headed that way now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.02,1:37:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们仍不能确定确切地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we haven't been able to pinpoint the exact location
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.92,1:38:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为少了特定的奥卡讯号对比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without the missing piece of the ORCA signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.03,1:38:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我有缺失的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.70,1:38:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哥斯拉 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Godzilla, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.73,1:38:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们已经试过了 - 这不是哥斯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know we already tried. - It's not Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.33,1:38:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.47,1:38:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的我们是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean "us"?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.17,1:38:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛吧哥斯拉和人类的生物声学混合到一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma combined the bioacoustics of Godzilla with a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.44,1:38:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是她如何制作的奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how she made the signal for the ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.24,1:38:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,其他生物认为这是另一个顶级捕食者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creatures just think it's another apex predator.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.34,1:38:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这就说的通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.91,1:38:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的确是一群好色又残暴的肉食者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we are a bunch of horny murderous carnivores.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.38,1:38:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好有哲理 现在怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's real poetic. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.01,1:38:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追踪它 锁定它 然后把我女儿抢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We track it, we find it, and we get my daughter back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.15,1:38:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这些马路三宝怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Moe, Larry, and Curly over here?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.59,1:38:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哥斯拉会重建平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godzilla will bring balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.56,1:38:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了 用芹泽让他们自己开打那招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I get it. A little Serizawa let-'em-fight action.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.36,1:38:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前超爱听他那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to love it when he said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.53,1:38:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这次我们要加入战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This time, we join the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.20,1:38:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你在干嘛吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.64,1:38:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我没时间和你吵 乔纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have time to argue about this, Jonah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.17,1:38:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把我的麦蒂找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting Maddie back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.24,1:38:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人不能带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not with my men, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.21,1:38:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛 你说这是为了世界大局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emma, you said this was about the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.71,1:38:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,地球应该被清理一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That the planet deserved a clean slate.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.11,1:38:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但你现在却准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now you're prepared
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.35,1:38:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,把大家置于险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to put all our lives in danger
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.62,1:38:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你的小女儿不见了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because your little girl is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.65,1:38:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,奥卡正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ORCA is with...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.88,1:38:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,奥卡已经不重要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ORCA no longer matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.49,1:39:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,人类无法控制自然法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man does not control the laws of nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.29,1:39:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.60,1:39:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经失去了一个孩子 不能再失去另一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already lost one child. I'm not losing another.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.97,1:39:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.98,1:39:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.28,1:39:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要的都得到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.14,1:41:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.63,1:43:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 锁定奥卡讯号最后一个音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we've zeroed in on the last ping from the ORCA.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.93,1:43:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,芬威公园 正前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenway Park, dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.60,1:43:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会用火力分散基多拉的注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll lay cover fire to keep Ghidorah distracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.90,1:43:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.84,1:43:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上校 所有中队锁定目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, all squadrons are locked on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.08,1:43:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为芹泽复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.21,1:43:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是我眼花还是它体格升级了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it just me or has he been working out?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.88,1:43:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮忙 别逗我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.05,1:43:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽给它吃了大力丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serizawa's got that lizard juiced
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.52,1:43:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太他妈厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.35,1:44:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小伙子们 哥斯拉的辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy. Godzilla's radiation levels
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.79,1:44:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要爆表了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are going through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.42,1:44:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在他产生热核反应前我们有12分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got about 12 minutes before he goes thermonuclear.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.96,1:44:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.03,1:44:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是12分钟后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying in about 12 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.50,1:44:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,红袜主场要被夷平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's gonna be a bad day to be a Red Sox fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.20,1:44:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 快找回奥卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, you need to find the ORCA,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.97,1:44:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,救回麦蒂 然后闪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get Madison, and get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.80,1:44:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,芹泽对哥斯做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever Serizawa did to Godzilla
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.44,1:44:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有点过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}worked a little too well.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.08,1:44:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他会像原子弹一样爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause he's about to explode like an atom bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.81,1:44:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.01,1:44:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,准备着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.77,1:44:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,上上上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.97,1:44:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 分散前进 - 在我左翼插进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spread out - Flank left
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.41,1:44:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On me
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.52,1:45:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,麦蒂森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.89,1:45:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我这有发现 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got something Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.36,1:45:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,过来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come check this out
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.39,1:45:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.06,1:45:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到奥卡了 看起来损毁严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found the ORCA, sir, it looks pretty banged up
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.83,1:45:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没看到你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.94,1:45:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她不在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not here
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.41,1:45:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.71,1:45:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,走走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.32,1:46:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.82,1:46:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.93,1:46:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.00,1:46:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,格里芬 你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Griffin, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.23,1:46:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,马丁内兹 帮我把她抬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martinez, let's get her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.64,1:47:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,麦蒂森在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Madison?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.94,1:47:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我觉得她在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I thought she was there
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.98,1:47:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？她不在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she's not there
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.72,1:47:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.92,1:47:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 按住那边 - 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get that side. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.02,1:47:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.49,1:47:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你找人的本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you're as good
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.83,1:47:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,和你把人弄丢的本事一样好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at finding her as you are losing her.
