Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.48,1:48:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哥斯拉的辐射值已到达临界点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godzilla's radiation's reaching critical mass.
